{title: Deck the Halls}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}

[G]Deck the halls with [G]boughs of holly,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la, la [D]la la [G]la.
[G]'Tis the season [G]to be jolly,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la, la [D]la la [G]la.
[D]Don we now our [G]gay apparel,
[G]Fa la la, [Em]la la la, [D]la [A]la [D]la.
[G]Troll the ancient [G]Yuletide carol,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la, la [D]la la [G]la.

[G]See the blazing [G]Yule before us,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la la [D]la la [G]la.
[G]Strike the harp and [G]join the chorus,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la la [D]la la [G]la.
[D]Follow me in [G]merry measure,
[G]Fa la la, [Em]la la la, [D]la [A]la [D]la.
[G]While I tell of [G]Yuletide treasure,
[C]Fa la la la la la [D]la la [G]la.

[G]Fast away the [G]old year passes,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la la [D]la la [G]la.
[G]Hail the new, ye [G]lads and lasses,
[C]Fa la la la [G]la la [D]la la [G]la.
[D]Sing we joyous [G]all together,
[G]Fa la la, [Em]la la la, [D]la [A]la [D]la.
[G]Heedless of the [G]wind and weather,
[C]Fa la la la la la [D]la la [G]la.
